{
    "title": "Face Beauty Makeup Camera-Self",
    "description": "Face Beauty Makeup Camera-Selfie Photo Editor is a new photo editor with all the latest makeup tools and effects. The application is an instant tool that will help you achieve perfection and give you a beautified version of yourself. Becoming beautiful was never this easy! Choose from a wide range of makeup tools, stickers, effects, filters and features that will transform your ordinary looking snaps to create stunning looking amazing images like a true professional makeup artist.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<b>FULL MAKEOVER:</b> Face Beauty Makeup Camera-Selfie Photo Editor is the best makeover makeup application with tons of amazing features. Completely change every facial feature. Make the skin color softer and fairer. Apply mascara, eye color and shadow to your eyes that make your eyes brighter and beautiful. Apply different shades of lipstick for your lips and blusher for your beautiful face. Create your favorite makeup look, change hair color and choose from different hairstyles.\r\n\r\nA dedicated photo editor to give the image finishing touch. Start by opening an image from gallery or capture a new selfie. Adjust the photo size by cropping in different aspect ratios. Rotate and flip the image. Adjust the brightness, contrast, saturation, and hue of the image. Apply makeover effects and filter in real-time on your photos. Choose from a wide range of stickers and add text to your edited image. Export the final result by saving it to an application folder in the gallery. \r\n\r\nNow you do not require Photoshop to make your faces pop in photos. The application is an instant virtual makeover tool that also has a camera with real-time filters and effects.\r\n\r\n\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728Face Beauty Makeup Tools\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc44 <b>LIPSTICKS:</b> \r\nChange Lips color with Lipstick color selection with different shades for lips makeup. Different Lipstick colors are added to the app to apply different shades to your lips in photos in case you forgot to apply lipstick before taking photos.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf80 <b>BLUSHES:</b> \r\nMake dull looking selfies shine by applying different blushes. Change the color of cheeks and change skin foundation.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc71\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <b>HAIR STYLES:</b> \r\nChange Hair Color of your selfies with Hair colorizer. Choose from Blonde Hair, Brunette, Grey Hair, Red Hair, White Hair, and Burgundy Hair colors.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude0d <b>EYE LENS:</b> \r\nChoose from multiple shades of eye lens. Change how your eyes look in the photo. Apply new eyelashes and eyebrows from a wide range of Eye Lashes and Eyebrows. Make eyes wider and brighter.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc40 <b>EYE SHADES:</b> \r\nA collection of different eye shadows with various colors to choose from. Have different eye colors to pop up your photos with mascara and eyeliner! \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc52 <b>ACCESSORIES:</b> \r\nYou can different 3D stickers, text, captions, oneliners, and quotes on your photos. You can add a diamond, jewelry, tattoos, glasses, and earrings.\r\n\r\nWithin a few minutes, you can have a perfect face like your favorite celebrity. Choose your favorite picture from the gallery, put some photo stickers, add effects, save the look and post it on social media platforms to get attention from all your friends. People will appreciate and adore the photo edited with this application. Make photo collages and photomontages! The photo editor will make perfection out of your ordinary-looking selfies. Share your beautified pictures with friends and reveal your photo editing skills!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Face Beauty Makeup Camera-Selfie Photo Editor is a new photo editor with all the latest makeup tools and effects. The application is an instant tool that will help you achieve perfection and give you a beautified version of yourself. Becoming beautiful was never this easy! Choose from a wide range of makeup tools, stickers, effects, filters and features that will transform your ordinary looking snaps to create stunning looking amazing images like a true professional makeup artist.<br><br>\ud83d\udc87\u200d\u2640\ufe0f<b>FULL MAKEOVER:</b> Face Beauty Makeup Camera-Selfie Photo Editor is the best makeover makeup application with tons of amazing features. Completely change every facial feature. Make the skin color softer and fairer. Apply mascara, eye color and shadow to your eyes that make your eyes brighter and beautiful. Apply different shades of lipstick for your lips and blusher for your beautiful face. Create your favorite makeup look, change hair color and choose from different hairstyles.<br><br>A dedicated photo editor to give the image finishing touch. Start by opening an image from gallery or capture a new selfie. Adjust the photo size by cropping in different aspect ratios. Rotate and flip the image. Adjust the brightness, contrast, saturation, and hue of the image. Apply makeover effects and filter in real-time on your photos. Choose from a wide range of stickers and add text to your edited image. Export the final result by saving it to an application folder in the gallery. <br><br>Now you do not require Photoshop to make your faces pop in photos. The application is an instant virtual makeover tool that also has a camera with real-time filters and effects.<br><br>\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728Face Beauty Makeup Tools\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728\u2728<br><br>\ud83d\udc44 <b>LIPSTICKS:</b> <br>Change Lips color with Lipstick color selection with different shades for lips makeup. Different Lipstick colors are added to the app to apply different shades to your lips in photos in case you forgot to apply lipstick before taking photos.<br><br>\ud83c\udf80 <b>BLUSHES:</b> <br>Make dull looking selfies shine by applying different blushes. Change the color of cheeks and change skin foundation.<br><br>\ud83d\udc71\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <b>HAIR STYLES:</b> <br>Change Hair Color of your selfies with Hair colorizer. Choose from Blonde Hair, Brunette, Grey Hair, Red Hair, White Hair, and Burgundy Hair colors.<br><br>\ud83d\ude0d <b>EYE LENS:</b> <br>Choose from multiple shades of eye lens. Change how your eyes look in the photo. Apply new eyelashes and eyebrows from a wide range of Eye Lashes and Eyebrows. Make eyes wider and brighter.<br><br>\ud83d\udc40 <b>EYE SHADES:</b> <br>A collection of different eye shadows with various colors to choose from. Have different eye colors to pop up your photos with mascara and eyeliner! <br><br>\ud83d\udc52 <b>ACCESSORIES:</b> <br>You can different 3D stickers, text, captions, oneliners, and quotes on your photos. You can add a diamond, jewelry, tattoos, glasses, and earrings.<br><br>Within a few minutes, you can have a perfect face like your favorite celebrity. Choose your favorite picture from the gallery, put some photo stickers, add effects, save the look and post it on social media platforms to get attention from all your friends. People will appreciate and adore the photo edited with this application. Make photo collages and photomontages! The photo editor will make perfection out of your ordinary-looking selfies. Share your beautified pictures with friends and reveal your photo editing skills!",
